        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>经营情况讨论及分析</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #333333;\n  }\n  .page-container {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 60px 80px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .side-tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 180px;\n    background-color: #e85d22;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 25px 10px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: mixed;\n    border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 5px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .content-box {\n    background-color: #fdf7f2;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 35px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .text-content {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-right: 50px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    color: #e85d22;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .title-dot {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 4px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background-color: #e85d22;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fdf7f2, 0 0 0 3.5px #e85d22;\n    margin-right: 15px;\n  }\n  .section-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #555555;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border: 1px dashed #e85d22;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    color: #e85d22;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 5px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed #dcdcdc;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #999999;\n  }\n  .footer-right {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .footer-page-num {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #666666;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n  <div class=\"side-tab\">经营情况讨论及分析</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n      <div class=\"text-content\">\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"title-dot\"></span>强大的线上+线下渠道网络</h3>\n        <p class=\"section-text\">线下，平安拥有超7,000个线下网点，覆盖全国330个城市，超130万人的产险、寿险等销售服务队伍，为客户提供专业的金融顾问式服务。线上，建立包括平安金管家、平安口袋银行、平安好车主、平安健康等在内的多个APP，为客户提供便捷的服务和优质产品。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: Network]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n      <div class=\"text-content\">\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"title-dot\"></span>强大的生态服务能力</h3>\n        <p class=\"section-text\">平安广泛的业务范围与强大的线上生态相结合，在医疗养老全阶段的场景下提供多元化的产品和服务。截至2024年末，近63%的客户同时享有医疗养老生态圈提供的服务权益，其客均合同数约3.37个、客均AUM约5.99万元，分别为不享有医疗养老生态圈服务权益的个人客户的1.6倍、3.8倍。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: Connected Circles]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n      <div class=\"text-content\">\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"title-dot\"></span>强大的科技平台能力</h3>\n        <p class=\"section-text\">平安拥有国际领先、亚洲最大的后援服务平台，2024年，AI坐席服务量约18.4亿次，覆盖平安80%的客服总量。平安深入推进全面数字化转型，运用科技助力金融业务提质增效和提升风控水平，2024年，平安产险反欺诈智能化理赔拦截减损119.4亿元。同时，平安借助综合金融的科技优势，不断提升服务能力与效率，满足集团内客户的多元化金融需求。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: Atom]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n      <div class=\"text-content\">\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"title-dot\"></span>高度协同的组织文化</h3>\n        <p class=\"section-text\">平安以价值最大化为核心的“一个平安”文化，让不同成员公司秉承“一个客户、多个账户、多种产品、一站式服务”这一共同经营理念，以提升客户价值为共同目标，在客户经营、风险管理、投资运作、后台集中与运营、消费者权益保护、品牌管理、价值体系等方面实现管理文化的协同与统一，助力实现各类业务紧密合作和资源集约，聚力推动集团个人客户数、客均合同数、客均利润的“三数”稳健增长与价值提升。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: Upward Chevron]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-right\">\n      <span>中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司</span>\n      <span class=\"footer-page-num\">17</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
